Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: Implicit move of `h.res`
  --> tests/ui/resource_move_needs_mark.jet:28:15
    |
 28 |     out = Val(h.res)
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: `h.res` holds a resource, which has one cleanup owner; this owning position takes it out of `h`, and a value with cleanup moves only where `.move()` writes the move
 Fix: Write the move `h.res.move()`, or use the value where it is
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209

